  "resolution_notes": [
    "A: spec says drop \"the 4 with short + filter off + buffer\" but that conjunction has only 2 cells (N=22,26); the 4 dropped here are all short + filter-off cells (both N, both rotations) so every retained cell keeps both rotation rules (balanced one-axis rotation neighbours) and the grid has exactly 12.",
    "B/C/E: \"4 rotation / N variants on the best-declared default\" -- of the 4 (N,rotation) cells one (22, buffer_2N) is already in the 8-cell factorial; the duplicate is removed per spec \u00a71 (deduplicate), giving 11 distinct.",
    "Best-declared defaults (declared before any V5 result): B h=20,W=250,score=P; C h=20,T=750,score=mean_p; E T=750,lambda=1.0,h=20. Rationale: horizon aligned with the 24-session episode, the longer window, and the simpler score variant.",
    "C and E signals depend on N (top-N agreement / top-N soft-portfolio utility), so their N variants carry top_n in the signal config; A and B signals do not depend on N.",
    "risk_aware scales daily vol20^2 by variance_horizon=20 so the variance term is on the same horizon as mu."
  ],
  "excluded_episodes": {
    "development_2010_01": "WARMUP: ensemble h20 and direct scores unavailable on day 1 (spec amendment 2, declared before any result)",
    "development_2010_02": "WARMUP: direct scores start 2010-02-26 (spec amendment 2, declared before any result)"
  }
